{"id":"8b663a0efd45aead","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor.md","title":"保有限积函子","display":"df-finite-product-preserving-functor — 保有限积函子","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor","display":"df-finite-product-preserving-functor — 保有限积函子","depends_on":["[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-finite-limits]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"source":"Preliminaries; product-preserving functors throughout Chapters 1–4","revision_date":"2026-10-15","aliases":["16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-product-preserving-functor — 保有限积函子"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Preliminaries; product-preserving functors throughout Chapters 1–4"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\">\\(F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a> 的函子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal D)\">\\(\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal D)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>。</li>\n<li>固定两范畴的终对象、二元积及投影；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_i^{A,B}\">\\(\\pi_i^{A,B}\\)</span> 指向相应积因子的投影。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_F\">\\(t_F\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{F,X,Y}\">\\(c_{F,X,Y}\\)</span> 是下文由泛性质定义的箭头。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal D}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal D}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(F)\\)</span> 是下文定义的谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的源、值域范畴作为当前固定参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F1_{\\mathcal C},1_{\\mathcal D})=\\{t_F\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F1_{\\mathcal C},1_{\\mathcal D})=\\{t_F\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\\Bigl[\nc_{F,X,Y}\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(X\\times Y),F(X)\\times F(Y))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\pi_1^{F(X),F(Y)}\\circ c_{F,X,Y}=F\\pi_1^{X,Y}\n\\land\\pi_2^{F(X),F(Y)}\\circ c_{F,X,Y}=F\\pi_2^{X,Y}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(X\\times Y),F(X)\\times F(Y)))\\\n\\bigl[\\pi_1^{F(X),F(Y)}\\circ h=F\\pi_1^{X,Y}\\land\n\\pi_2^{F(X),F(Y)}\\circ h=F\\pi_2^{X,Y}\\Rightarrow h=c_{F,X,Y}\\bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\\Bigl[\nc_{F,X,Y}\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(X\\times Y),F(X)\\times F(Y))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\pi_1^{F(X),F(Y)}\\circ c_{F,X,Y}=F\\pi_1^{X,Y}\n\\land\\pi_2^{F(X),F(Y)}\\circ c_{F,X,Y}=F\\pi_2^{X,Y}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(X\\times Y),F(X)\\times F(Y)))\\\n\\bigl[\\pi_1^{F(X),F(Y)}\\circ h=F\\pi_1^{X,Y}\\land\n\\pi_2^{F(X),F(Y)}\\circ h=F\\pi_2^{X,Y}\\Rightarrow h=c_{F,X,Y}\\bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal D}(t_F)\\land\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\\ \\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal D}(c_{F,X,Y}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal D}(t_F)\\land\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\\ \\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal D}(c_{F,X,Y}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>终对象保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_F\">\\(t_F\\)</span> 唯一存在；积泛性质保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_{F,X,Y}\">\\(c_{F,X,Y}\\)</span> 唯一存在，通常记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle F\\pi_1,F\\pi_2\\rangle\">\\(\\langle F\\pi_1,F\\pi_2\\rangle\\)</span>。因而这两组形式条件定义实际的箭头，而不是无来源的比较名称。</li>\n<li>更换终对象和积的选择，以唯一同构共轭比较箭头，故所得性质不依赖选择。保持性要求规范比较可逆。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, Preliminaries 与 Chapters 1–4 所用的 product-preserving functor；本页展开标准规范比较。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$ 为 [[16-df-functor]] 的函子，$\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal C)$、$\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal D)$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$ 为 [[16-df-functor]] 的函子，$\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal C)$、$\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal D)$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal D}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]；$\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(F)$ 是下文定义的谓词，$F$ 的源、值域范畴作为当前固定参数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_i^{A,B}","display":false},{"tex":"t_F","display":false},{"tex":"c_{F,X,Y}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal D}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F1_{\\mathcal C},1_{\\mathcal D})=\\{t_F\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\\Bigl[\nc_{F,X,Y}\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(X\\times Y),F(X)\\times F(Y))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\pi_1^{F(X),F(Y)}\\circ c_{F,X,Y}=F\\pi_1^{X,Y}\n\\land\\pi_2^{F(X),F(Y)}\\circ c_{F,X,Y}=F\\pi_2^{X,Y}\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(F(X\\times Y),F(X)\\times F(Y)))\\\n\\bigl[\\pi_1^{F(X),F(Y)}\\circ h=F\\pi_1^{X,Y}\\land\n\\pi_2^{F(X),F(Y)}\\circ h=F\\pi_2^{X,Y}\\Rightarrow h=c_{F,X,Y}\\bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(F)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal D}(t_F)\\land\n(\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\\ \\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal D}(c_{F,X,Y}).","display":true},{"tex":"t_F","display":false},{"tex":"c_{F,X,Y}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle F\\pi_1,F\\pi_2\\rangle","display":false}],"bytes":2276,"backlinks":[{"id":"396e57d7540c9d0e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"对 $t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_\\Sigma(\\Gamma,\\sigma)$，$\\widehat t_\\varnothing=\\langle\\Gamma,(\\sigma),([t]_\\varnothing)\\rangle$；$N\\Gamma$ 为 $N_0\\Gamma$，$N(\\widehat t_\\varnothing)$ 为 $N_1(\\widehat t_\\varnothing)$。模型谓词和解释记号如下定义；项解释及 $N\\models_\\Sigma e$ 仅在 $\\mathsf{SigModel}_\\Sigma(\\mathcal B,N)$ 成立的合法输入上使用；$\\mathrm{Functor}$、$\\mathrm{PresFinProd}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]。"},{"id":"fcddcc8eb9f89d5d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\delta=\\delta^p_{I,J}:U\\to V$，$U=I\\times J,V=(I\\times J)\\times J$。在 $K$ 保有限积时，$a=c_{K,I,J}:KU\\xrightarrow{\\sim}KI\\times KJ$、$b=(a\\times\\operatorname{id}_{KJ})c_{K,U,J}:KV\\xrightarrow{\\sim}(KI\\times KJ)\\times KJ$ 取 [[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]] 的规范比较。$L$ 在下文正式构造，$\\epsilon^L$ 为该伴随的余单位。"},{"id":"ee7c0663947fd7d2","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinProd}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]；$\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(F)$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]，其源范畴和值域由此处已声明的 $F$ 固定。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-natural-transformation-definition]]、[[16-df-adjoint-functors]]、[[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-pullback-square]]、[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]、[[16-df-elementary-topos]]、[[16-df-nno]]、[[16-df-fibre]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-coproducts]]、[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-fibre-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]。"},{"id":"c4ad19a65f2d8802","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinProd}$、$\\mathrm{PresFinProd}$、$\\mathrm{FibFinProd}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]、[[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]；其源靶范畴均取当前函子的已声明类型。"},{"id":"83dcad167d47dee4","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf C_A=\\mathbf C(\\Sigma,A)$ 和 $Q_A$ 采用 [[16-df-algebraic-category]]；谓词 $\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{FinProd}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$、$\\mathrm{PresFinProd}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]。"}],"outgoing":["fc49efccd7348d66","b75e7c168ac56b22","dacf0503b95c88a9"]}